  "slots": [
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-001",
      "tts_text_en": "At noon, witnesses reported a bell sounding from a tower built without one.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-001.wav",
      "start_seconds": 0.414,
      "end_seconds": 6.322,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 5.909
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-002",
      "tts_text_en": "The mounting frame stood empty, with no bell or other sound-making instrument in view.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-002.wav",
      "start_seconds": 6.598,
      "end_seconds": 12.962,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.364
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-003",
      "tts_text_en": "The event is clear in outline: a reported sound, an empty frame, and an unidentified source.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-003.wav",
      "start_seconds": 13.238,
      "end_seconds": 20.511,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 7.273
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-004",
      "tts_text_en": "That unanswered contrast begins the case.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-004.wav",
      "start_seconds": 20.787,
      "end_seconds": 23.587,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-005",
      "tts_text_en": "Clock repairer Mira Vale follows the evidence because her brother is missing.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-005.wav",
      "start_seconds": 26.0,
      "end_seconds": 31.455,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 5.455
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-006",
      "tts_text_en": "A note attributed to him was left among the materials on her workbench.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-006.wav",
      "start_seconds": 32.978,
      "end_seconds": 38.886,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 5.909
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-007",
      "tts_text_en": "Beside it rests a brass moth, a small object whose purpose is still unknown.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-007.wav",
      "start_seconds": 40.408,
      "end_seconds": 46.772,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.364
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-008",
      "tts_text_en": "Clocks and records repeat nine seventeen, bringing the note, moth, and time into one sequence.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-008.wav",
      "start_seconds": 48.294,
      "end_seconds": 55.112,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.818
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-009",
      "tts_text_en": "Together they form a trail of clues, though not a map to her brother.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-009.wav",
      "start_seconds": 56.634,
      "end_seconds": 62.998,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.364
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-010",
      "tts_text_en": "The note leads Mira to a ledger divided into two facing columns.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-010.wav",
      "start_seconds": 67.0,
      "end_seconds": 72.455,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 5.455
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-011",
      "tts_text_en": "One column records minutes; the other records people's names.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-011.wav",
      "start_seconds": 74.667,
      "end_seconds": 78.758,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 4.091
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-012",
      "tts_text_en": "The visible pages establish those two categories, while their purpose remains unresolved.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-012.wav",
      "start_seconds": 80.97,
      "end_seconds": 86.425,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 5.455
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-013",
      "tts_text_en": "Their relationship to the missing brother is a question the case has not answered.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-013.wav",
      "start_seconds": 88.637,
      "end_seconds": 95.001,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.364
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-014",
      "tts_text_en": "From the ledger, the investigation turns toward the city council indicated by the note.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-014.wav",
      "start_seconds": 99.0,
      "end_seconds": 105.364,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.364
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-015",
      "tts_text_en": "The note makes the council relevant, but remains an allegation rather than proof of involvement.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-015.wav",
      "start_seconds": 108.849,
      "end_seconds": 115.667,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.818
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-016",
      "tts_text_en": "The ledger's origin and authenticity are also open questions.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-016.wav",
      "start_seconds": 119.152,
      "end_seconds": 123.243,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 4.091
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-017",
      "tts_text_en": "So the council, the ledger, and the tower occupy the same investigation without a proven mechanism.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-017.wav",
      "start_seconds": 126.728,
      "end_seconds": 134.001,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 7.273
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-018",
      "tts_text_en": "What is established is the evidence set: reported bell, empty frame, note, brass moth, nine seventeen, ledger.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-018.wav",
      "start_seconds": 138.0,
      "end_seconds": 145.727,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 7.727
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-019",
      "tts_text_en": "The ledger visibly separates minutes from names, but the significance of those categories remains uncertain.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-019.wav",
      "start_seconds": 147.204,
      "end_seconds": 154.022,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.818
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-020",
      "tts_text_en": "The source of the sound and the location of Mira's brother are still unknown.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-020.wav",
      "start_seconds": 155.499,
      "end_seconds": 161.863,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 6.364
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-021",
      "tts_text_en": "Any connection between the council and the collected evidence is likewise unresolved.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-021.wav",
      "start_seconds": 163.34,
      "end_seconds": 168.795,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 5.455
    },
    {
      "utterance_id": "cd-doc-en-022",
      "tts_text_en": "For now, the tower remains an open case, defined as much by its limits as its clues.",
      "expected_relative_path": "accepted-take/utterances/cd-doc-en-022.wav",
      "start_seconds": 170.272,
      "end_seconds": 177.999,
      "maximum_duration_seconds": 7.727
    }
  ]
